      "text": "Jacob2 has been diligent in office of his calling, Jacob 2:3. priests are called with holy calling, Alma 13:3–8. God has called Alma2 with holy calling, Alma 29:13. priests and teachers are ordained according to gifts and callings of God unto men, Moro. 3:4. Mormon2 permitted to speak because of gift of Christ’s calling unto him, Moro. 7:2.",
